{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>A unique cooperative horror RPG</strong><br>Whispers in the Dark is an online horror game where you manage a <strong>paranormal agency</strong>. With your teammates, explore haunted locations, gather clues, and face terrifying entities. Your progression relies on an <strong>innovative research system</strong> that expands your Codex, skills, and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>A research system that changes everything</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions</strong> \u2192 unlock new maps and paranormal cases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong> \u2192 develop your abilities and unlock new tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Entities</strong> \u2192 study and identify the 12 ghosts, revealing their sensitivities and curses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Full RPG progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience and spend <strong>skill points</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle (investigator, tool specialist, hardened survivor).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to <strong>8 skills</strong> to create a unique role within the team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Evolving equipment</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide range of tools (EMF, candle, ghostly book, UV camera, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each item comes in <strong>three qualities</strong>: cheap (fragile), good (reliable), or <strong>excellent/legendary</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare artifacts like the <strong>Montserrat Crucifix</strong> can turn the tide of a mission.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Co-op horror with replayability</strong><br>Each investigation is different: phenomena, behaviors, and clues vary with your choices and progression.<br>Survive, banish, or seal the entity within its <strong>hearth</strong> (fetish object)\u2026 if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for <strong>1\u20134 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative research system (missions, skills, entities, items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG progression with XP, skill points, and specializations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 entities</strong> with unique spells, sensitivities, and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tools with <strong>3 quality levels</strong> (common \u2192 legendary)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, oppressive atmosphere with high replay value</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Immortal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/b5c8c9b5da3151f41ef579fee2146810fa130b96.jpg"},{"name":"Clean sheet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/8fd11b91639c802f0f426fae72213b0848d6f721.jpg"},{"name":"Local case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/581c9e6d3e36457e775266c6d3fef9558a447b99.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/ec394f9c229f20381f5649198d4e98aa210ff5fd.jpg"},{"name":"Urban legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/4da69e1311b637fee90ab9ecb8b338ebc9f7a42d.jpg"},{"name":"Ghost hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/414baad27329d86437278047594af0dcc17a2d39.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2262890/f44122fa6bf7621c75c5c8b9290c621